          "description": "A deep dish used for holding or cooking food or liquids, usually made of clay or metal."
        }
      ]
    },
    "apd": {
      "preferred_label": "صحن غريق",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "صحن غريق بستعملوهو عشان يحطو فيهو أو يطبخو فيهو الأكل أو السوائل، وعادةً بكون مصنوع من الطين أو المعدن."
        }
      ]
    },
    "arb": {
      "preferred_label": "صَحْفَة",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "إناء عميق يُستخدم لحفظ أو طهي الطعام أو السوائل، وعادة ما يُصنع من الطين أو المعدن."
        }
      ]
    },
    "bis": {
      "preferred_label": "dis",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wan dip plet no dis we oli yusum blong putum no kukum kakae no wota, plante taem oli mekem long klei no aean."
        }
      ]
    },
    "fra": {
      "preferred_label": "bol",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Récipient creux servant à contenir ou cuire des aliments ou des liquides, généralement fait d’argile ou de métal."
        }
      ]
    },
    "hau": {
      "preferred_label": "kwano",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Zurfaffen kwano da ake amfani da shi wajen zuba ko dafa abinci ko abubuwan sha, wanda aka saba yi da yumɓu ko ƙarfe."
        }
      ]
    },
    "hin": {
      "preferred_label": "कटोरा",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "भोजन या तरल पदार्थों को रखने अथवा पकाने के लिए प्रयुक्त होने वाला एक गहरा बर्तन, जो आमतौर पर मिट्टी या धातु का बना होता है।"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ibo": {
      "preferred_label": "Efere",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Efere dị omimi a na-eji adọba ma ọ bụ esi nri ma ọ bụ ihe ọṅụṅụ, nke e ji ájá ụrọ ma ọ bụ igwe mee."
        }
      ]
    },
    "ind": {
      "preferred_label": "pinggan",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wadah cekung yang digunakan untuk menaruh atau memasak makanan atau cairan, biasanya terbuat dari tanah liat atau logam."
        }
      ]
    },
    "nep": {
      "preferred_label": "कचौरा",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "खाना वा तरल पदार्थ राख्‍न वा पकाउन प्रयोग गरिने गहिरो भाँडो, प्रायः माटो वा धातुबाट बनाइएको हुन्छ ।"
        }
      ]
    },
    "por": {
      "preferred_label": "tigela",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Um recipiente fundo usado para conter ou cozinhar alimentos ou líquidos, geralmente feito de barro ou metal."
        }
      ]
    },
    "rus": {
      "preferred_label": "блюдо",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Глубокая посуда, используемая для хранения или приготовления пищи или жидкостей, обычно из глины или металла."
        }
      ]
    },
    "spa": {
      "preferred_label": "plato hondo",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Recipiente hondo utilizado para contener o cocinar alimentos o líquidos, generalmente hecho de barro o metal."
        }
      ]
    },
    "swh": {
      "preferred_label": "Bakuli",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Chombo cha mviringo chenye kina kinachotumika kuwekea au kupikia chakula au vimiminika, ambacho kwa kawaida hutengenezwa kwa udongo au chuma."
        }
      ]
    },
    "tpi": {
      "preferred_label": "dis",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Wanpela bikpela dis o plet ol i save yusim bilong holim o kukim kaikai o dring, planti taim ol i wokim long graun o kapa/ain."
        }
      ]
    },
    "vie": {
      "preferred_label": "bát",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "Vật dụng sâu lòng dùng để đựng hoặc nấu thức ăn hay chất lỏng, thường làm bằng đất nung hoặc kim loại."
        }
      ]
    },
    "zhs": {
      "preferred_label": "碗",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "用来盛放或烹煮食物或液体的深盘，通常由陶土或金属制成。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "zht": {
      "preferred_label": "碗",
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "source": "acai",
          "description": "一種盛裝或烹調食物或液體的深盤或深碗，通常由陶土或金屬製成。"
        }
      ]
    }
